  #line-at(93.781pt, 642.24pt, "three variants, the passing over this area was reduced. In the area of the side edge, a deterioration in ")
  #line-at(93.781pt, 654.12pt, "the edge quality can be clearly recognised in the case of LTS. The edge shows a high surface quality ")
