  #line-at(125.34pt, 585.42pt, " Schematic of the laser-structured Au-layer (left side) showing the rectangular separation path placed beyond the ")
  #line-at(95.4pt, 595.2pt, "cavity. To obtain a certain path width, 5 parallel lines with 5 µm distance were applied. The laser power was 0,88 W and the ")
  #line-at(98.64pt, 604.92pt, "pattern was repeated three times. The SEM image on the right side shows a clear removal of the thin gold layer. The slight ")
  #line-at(93.9pt, 614.7pt, "difference in the shade of grey inside and outside the rectangle, which is due to different electrical charges, already visualises ")
