  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12.237pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(93.78pt, 656.76pt, "3.4 UV laser cutting within the locally thinned areas ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.32pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(93.78pt, 669.12pt, "PMN-PT based piezo platforms realized by laser cutting for quantum optical applications has already ")
  #line-at(93.78pt, 680.94pt, "been successfully demonstrated [28], [29], [30]. The cutting process was based on the creation of ")
  #line-at(93.78pt, 692.88pt, "equidistant lines to the cutting path geometry with variable line spacings. Process parameters like ")
  #line-at(93.78pt, 704.76pt, "fluence and repetition rate were within a narrow process window allowing cutting with minimal ")
  #line-at(93.78pt, 716.7pt, "thermal stress on this very sensitive material. Regarding the influence of the wavelength, the laser was ")
